# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system e74a3eb9212aa1c44cea0ff1f1d7948da657d72762bd783578e20d0e8b4a8246
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 1d6083c2a757ab6e055fdcfc12ecfa433707a4c2f395f9cbda33e3e2b9af2eda
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 447b18521a45ba0d1927b4e7b62d297b31cb73fad226619d1c324be9fdd11740
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock d1dcac7acc9da263fd44b87775b3e944782adf92883813720e6f2fd6e07f2880
